Description: Pop COSMIC desktop experience for GNOME Shell 48+
 A modernized port of the Pop COSMIC desktop environment for GNOME Shell 48
 and later. Includes the pop-cosmic and cosmic-workspaces GNOME Shell
 extensions, a Python/Libadwaita settings application, Pop GTK theme,
 Pop icon theme, and Pop wallpapers.
 .
 This package provides a complete Pop desktop experience on top of a
 standard GNOME session.
